From 734f6ad3c059f0ef0fcfd70ff2f3d161fa312823 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Kunnapatara <kunnapatara@yahoo.com>
Date: Thu, 22 Oct 2026 08:07:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(phase-1): resolve evidence integrity and re-scan
 verification semantics

- Media integrity: compute SHA-256 for media files in mediaInspector and surface version identity in re-scan comparison.
- Thumbnail analysis: do not fabricate highContrastText or sensational cues from luminance/filename; declare visualAnalysisStatus as NOT_ASSESSED; output signalstats YAVG via metadata print filter.
- Audio & video processor: declare speechAnalysisStatus, musicAnalysisStatus, slideshowAnalysisStatus, and repeatedFootageStatus as NOT_ASSESSED / NOT_PROVIDED rather than false negatives.
- Policy intelligence & re-scan: track media identity, require clean evidence domain resolution before resolving prior findings, record notVerifiedIssues.
- Automated tests: add Phase 1 regression verification suite covering media SHA-256, fail-closed unassessed domains, and re-scan issue tracking.
